ind their own motivation and no  matter what that is no matter what they  want to do in life i hope that they work  really hard i think they have good  example i learned from seeing both of my  parents work really hard and i think our  kids will see you know  kanye and i work really hard and i hope  that's motivating for them and just to  find their own path  [Music]
 

